  "why": "The Counting chapter merged into chapter 3 'Having & Needing' (numbers are first needed for age). Its exercises leaned on ci sono, plurals and articles (ci sono tre sedie, libri sul tavolo) before those are taught, and its tips explained number formation, which now goes in the new-words list and later the numbers grammar unit.",
